        DESCRIPTION "A Wilderist, Antunnos believes that humankind must be penned. The modified heartbeast ritual will tether the humans to Rossen-Antunnuac. He also firmly believes that the six Clans of his House are fragmenting; dispersing it as a political force within the Order. From the town, he plans to strengthen Wilderist allegiances within House Bjornaer. This would enable the Wilderists to secure spiritual places, and potentially strengthen the Order’s fonts of magic."
